  "details": "Better Menu Interface. No realtime menu pls.\n\nKeyboard buttons to trigger any emoji, emotes.\n\nAllow user to customise keyboard binding in game.\n\nAllow user to respawn without opening menu Eg. Alt + R\n\nAllow Player to loop Emotes Eg. if u emote die, u stay lying down.\n\nBetter refresh rate of joining friends that leave the current room Eg. Was about to join my friend, he then told me he's joining other world, after he joins the world, i still need to wait for the world in the friend list to be updated. This needed a fix.\n\nAble to chat people with text.\nnot everyone have mic. \nEg. Whisper chat to friends.\n\nI was told that this game was running thru our CUP not our GPU. it would be better if we are are using our GPU to run the game. it would be much smooth.",
